Generating initial strategy for: Text-to-SQL generation on the Spider benchmark. The model reads a schema (tables and columns) and a natural-language question, then emits a single SQL query as its output. The parser validates the query against a SQL grammar that is dynamically narrowed to the current schemas tables and columns.

